special_description = "Basic: a sphere of Reiatsu that bursts where it lands (press while it flies to detonate it mid-air in a wider blast). Two hits in a row put the enemy under Spiritual Pressure, so their next throw has no aim guide. Special: Kyoka Suigetsu adds a stack of pressure, and the next throw that would hit him lands on the thrower instead (they were standing in his place all along); he steals their buffs and heals 5. Lasts until it triggers. Below 40 HP he evolves: wings, a stronger Hado, and his pressure fills the arena for good (the enemy never gets an aim guide again)."
price = 1000
